        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Natasha \"Tasha\" Hunter, Isabel Lucas\n- Products: Home and Away, Daybreakers, The Pacific, Immortals, Red Dawn\n- Roles: fictional character, actress, model\n\nFacts:\n- Natasha \"Tasha\" Hunter, also known as Tasha Andrews, is a fictional character from the Australian soap opera Home and Away.\n- Isabel Lucas played Natasha \"Tasha\" Hunter in Home and Away.\n- Isabel Lucas was born on 29 January 1985.\n- Isabel Lucas is an Australian actress and model.\n- Isabel Lucas is best known for roles in Home and Away from 2003 to 2006, Daybreakers in 2009, The Pacific in 2010, Immortals in 2011, and Red Dawn in 2012.",
